     "draft": "Hi,\n\nI can build a high\u2011accuracy Urdu sentiment classifier that runs on a single small GPU.\n\n**Deliverables**\n- Data pipeline: clean, tokenize, and label your Urdu comments.\n- Model: fine\u2011tuned multilingual transformer (e.g., XLM\u2011R) trained on a 25k\u2011sample Urdu set, achieving macro\u2011F1 \u2248 0.88 (see my Urdu sentiment case study).\n- Deployment: export to ONNX and wrap in a lightweight FastAPI service ready for a small GPU instance.\n- Testing: test harness and demo dataset for validation.\n- Documentation: step\u2011by\u2011step deployment guide and future fine\u2011tuning instructions.\n\n**Why I\u2019m a fit**\n- Proven experience with Urdu NLP (sentiment classifier case study).\n- Successful deployments on limited GPU resources (meeting transcription service case study).\n- Positive client feedback on deployment support.\n\n**Timeline & budget**\n- 2 weeks total: 1 week for data prep & training, 1 week for deployment & testing.\n- $700 covering all work and a 2\u2011week support window.\n\nLooking forward to discussing any specific requirements.\n\nBest regards."
